(63, 5, 'staff', '1.Himaniben Chandak RCT<br />\r\n 1. Scan done, crown preparation demo given ( discussion regarding preparation). Access opening observed. Irrigation aspiration and filing done with 10k and 15k hand files. <br />\r\nObserved the entire single sitting RCT procedure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n 2.Mamtaben U Patel <br />\r\nHave to discuss in detail regarding Maryland bridge delivered today.<br />\r\nAll eight intra-oral photographs taken after checking the torque.<br />\r\nPatient\'s OPG taken and we shared on group.<br />\r\nHelped her to make a small speech for testimonial.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n Azharbhai Mansuri CF <br />\r\nDemonstration of matrix band placement with wedge and class II composite restoration. I missed the demo asI wasn\'t able to see properly 🙈.<br />\r\nDoubts: shade matching technique, finishing and polishing burs and composite instruments names<br />\r\nManoj and I informed and counseled the patient to get composite restoration in Class I cavity 36.<br />\r\nPatient felt the cavity was underfilled. We took intra-oral photographs and explained him. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nReenaba Jadeja extraction 28.<br />\r\nI started observing Dr. Nishil when tooth was grade II mobile and he easily removed it with forceps.<br />\r\nI couldn\'t observe the elevation technique using luxator and how 27 crown came out.<br />\r\n Observed the suturing technique <br />\r\n<br />\r\n *Jitendra chawla*RCT and post and core<br />\r\nObserved the entire RCT procedure.<br />\r\nThe reason why endo motor stopped working and how to maintain it?<br />\r\nDiscuss regarding the drills used in post and coreehich drills? How deep one should drill? How to bond in a way the orifice doesn\'t get blocked by bonding agent. Etch and bond the post.', NULL, 2, '2024-10-05 14:19:58'),
(64, 5, 'staff', '25/8/2024:<br />\r\nObserved Dhara Patel\'s scaling and polishing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2. New OPD Bharatbhai pain in 36. Amalgam Restoration.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nConsultation observed, I took the OPG for patient. Reviewed all medications he was currently taking. Dr. Pooja prescribed Metrogyl ER and Keterol DT ( avoided Moxclav as pt has acidity issues and health anxiety related to cardiac issues )<br />\r\nDiagnosis: 36 either extraction Rs 2000or RCT Rs 12000. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n3. Jitendra Chawla<br />\r\nObserved access opening of 14 and crown preparation of 33 and 14. Observed WL and BMP done by Dr. Pooja.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n4. Preetbhai Shah<br />\r\nObserved surgical extraction done for 18 and Mesially impacted 48 . Always keep peziotome ready for surgical extraction.', NULL, 2, '2024-10-05 14:20:36'),
